 "paragraphs": [
  "Aliya and Zade arrived back at the picnic. Their mother asked if they had fun in the mangroves. They nodded and looked at each other with wide smiles that hid secrets of their afternoon adventures.",
  "When their father asked what they did, Aliya answered, “Oh, we just saw some animals and counted some stuff.”"
 ],
